# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:4
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_93f8fa7b:

    # VES @ smile_talk "Good!"
    VES @ smile_talk "좋아!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:5
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_40e98cec:

    # VES @ talk "Give me a moment to get my stuff..."
    VES @ talk "잠깐만... 짐을 챙길게..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:7
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_f3afe333:

    # "Ves pushed open the flap of her tent as she headed inside of it once again. My thoughts turned to the Skorn."
    "베스가 텐트의 덮개를 열고 다시 안으로 들어갔다. 내 생각은 스코른에게로 향했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:8
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_00ba4f91:

    # "I had heard about them in class, the great desert bison that roamed the harsh Valley of Death but had never seen one before with my own eyes."
    "수업 시간에 들어본 적은 있었다. 거친 죽음의 계곡을 배회하는 거대한 사막 들소에 대해... 하지만 직접 본 적은 한 번도 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:11
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_8917f7b8:

    # "Ves quickly returned holding her sharpened axes, a spear, and other such equipment."
    "베스가 날카로운 도끼와 창, 그리고 여러 장비를 들고 금방 돌아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:12
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_ea1b9968:

    # VES @ talk "Are you ready?"
    VES @ talk "준비됐어?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:13
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_69b977f8:

    # MC @ talk "As I'll ever be."
    MC @ talk "나름대로 준비는 됐어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:14
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_ddd012a7:

    # VES @ talk "It's at least an hour or so trek on foot... I've got water but be prepared, the desert is harsher than you know."
    VES @ talk "걸어서 최소 한 시간은 걸려... 물은 챙겼지만 각오는 단단히 해둬. 사막은 네가 생각하는 것보다 훨씬 가혹하니까."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:15
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_b9615875:

    # MC @ talk "... I think I can speed things up."
    MC @ talk "... 속도를 좀 낼 수 있을 것 같아."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:19
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_41855953:

    # "Ves' eyes widened and she flushed red watching me strip off my clothes in front of her."
    "베스의 눈이 커지고 얼굴이 붉어졌다. 그녀 앞에서 내가 옷을 벗는 모습을 지켜보면서."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:20
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_7830f23f:

    # VES @ surp_talk "W-What are you doing?!"
    VES @ surp_talk "뭐, 뭐 하는 거야?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:21
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_a90fa2cc:

    # "Ves' eyes stared down at the cock dangling in front of her."
    "베스의 눈이 그녀 앞에서 매달려 있는 자지 쪽으로 내려갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:22
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_6893e75d:

    # MC @ talk "I'm going to transform."
    MC @ talk "변신하려고."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:23
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_c9cfd6f3:

    # MC @ talk "I can get us across the desert and back much faster in my other form."
    MC @ talk "다른 모습으로 변하면 사막을 훨씬 빨리 건널 수 있어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:24
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_5a9db378:

    # "Turning paler white than I had ever seen her before, Ves looked away anxiously."
    "지금껏 본 적 없이 창백해진 베스가 불안한 듯 시선을 돌렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:25
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_f37a4c98:

    # VES @ surp_talk "I... Yes, that makes sense."
    VES @ surp_talk "그... 그래, 그게 낫겠네."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:27
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_49a9f33d:

    # "As I took off the last of my clothes, now accustomed to the once agonizing, brutal transformation after some painful 'adjustments'..."
    "마지막 옷을 벗으면서... 한때는 고통스럽고 잔혹했던 변신도 몇 번의 괴로운 '적응'을 거치며 이제는 익숙해졌다..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:29
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_cb457db2:

    # "I changed myself into my second form in record time."
    "나는 기록적인 속도로 두 번째 모습으로 변신했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:34
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_72b75bad:

    # MC "Are you ready?"
    MC "준비됐어?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:35
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_630a7504:

    # VES @ surp_talk "How will you—"
    VES @ surp_talk "어떻게—"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:36
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_6678a294:

    # VES @ surp_talk "H-HEY!"
    VES @ surp_talk "어, 어이!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:37
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_9eb609df:

    # "I scoped Ves up under my arm."
    "나는 베스를 팔 아래로 낚아챘다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:38
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_29bb6266:

    # MC "Which way?"
    MC "어느 쪽이야?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:39
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_6000cfb1:

    # VES @ surp_talk "... T-That way."
    VES @ surp_talk "... 저, 저쪽."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:46
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_45ffaade:

    # "Ves pointed in the direction, and I followed."
    "베스가 방향을 가리켰고, 나는 그대로 따라갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:47
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_a057a701:

    # "With Ves in my arms, I quickly began to propel us across the hot desert sands with the thick tentacles swinging us across like vines, covering miles in mere moments."
    "베스를 품에 안은 채, 나는 두꺼운 촉수를 덩굴처럼 휘둘러 뜨거운 사막 모래 위를 빠르게 가로질렀다. 순식간에 수 마일을 나아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:48
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_59b56fc8:

    # "Ves seemed slightly unsure of what to do as she was cradled in my arms."
    "내 품에 안긴 베스는 어찌할 바를 몰라 하는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:49
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_d63ba394:

    # "I towered over her in this form, and no doubt this shape still had some strange, terrifying quality to those unaccustomed to seeing it."
    "이 모습의 나는 그녀보다 훨씬 컸고, 이 형체는 보는 이에게 여전히 낯설고 섬뜩한 느낌을 주는 게 분명했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:50
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_f9c04db8:

    # "Still, as the sun beat on my back and the cool breeze passed us by, she seemed to relax, curiously tracing her fingers along the hard exterior of my flesh inquisitively."
    "하지만 등에 내리쬐는 태양과 스쳐 지나가는 시원한 바람 속에서 그녀는 조금씩 긴장을 풀며, 호기심 어린 손가락으로 내 단단한 피부 표면을 조심스레 더듬었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:52
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_44e2d2f3:

    # "Finally, we arrived upon some great flat valley where just across the ridge below revealed a great herd of Skorn."
    "마침내 우리는 거대하고 평평한 계곡에 도착했다. 바로 아래 능선 너머에는 스코른의 거대한 무리가 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:53
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_d83ff686:

    # "Huge towering three-eyed beasts with legs the size of small buildings, their long trunks pushed deep down into the desert, finding water in minutes that would take men hours to dig far enough down to find."
    "작은 건물만 한 다리를 가진, 우뚝 솟은 세 개의 눈을 가진 짐승들. 긴 코를 사막 깊숙이 찔러 넣어, 사람이 몇 시간을 파야 찾을 수 있는 물을 몇 분 만에 찾아낸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:54
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_7104dc8c:

    # MC "...They are... bigger than I imagined."
    MC "...생각보다 훨씬 크네."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:55
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_5fb0397f:

    # VES "Come... We must take the strongest one."
    VES "가자... 가장 강한 놈을 잡아야 해."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:56
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_e1f6d48f:

    # MC "Huh? Why do you—"
    MC "어? 왜—"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:57
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_1eb152e3:

    # VES "To go for the weak or young is shameful..."
    VES "약한 놈이나 어린 놈을 노리는 건 수치스러운 일이야..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:58
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_f55dd0c3:

    # VES "When we hunt, {i}what{/i} we hunt is of great importance."
    VES "우리가 사냥할 때, {i}무엇을{/i} 사냥하느냐가 대단히 중요하다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:59
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_50e59b58:

    # "Readying her axes, Ves scanned across the many Skorn before pointing out one of the largest amongst them with a slightly darker complexion."
    "도끼를 손에 쥔 베스는 수많은 스코른을 훑어보더니, 살짝 더 어두운 피부색을 가진 가장 큰 놈 중 하나를 가리켰다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:60
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_f992c33d:

    # "Its ram-like horns formidable in size, made it appear like some ancient god of the desert."
    "숫양을 닮은 거대한 뿔은 그 짐승을 사막의 고대 신처럼 보이게 만들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:61
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_75419991:

    # MC "What's the plan to—"
    MC "어떻게 할 건데—"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:62
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_42a2e82a:

    # "Before I could finish my sentence, Ves charged like a woman possessed with both her axes towards the colossal Skorn."
    "내가 말을 끝내기도 전에 베스는 두 손에 도끼를 쥐고 마치 귀신 들린 듯 거대한 스코른을 향해 돌격했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:63
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0c5d5516:

    # VES "GRGHHHHH!"
    VES "끄르아아아아!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:64
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_93c13848:

    # MC "(... Well, fuck.)"
    MC "(... 이런, 젠장.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:65
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_94f9d7ee:

    # "Following after her, the other now spooked Skorn noticing her presence instinctively began to flee."
    "그녀를 따라가자, 베스의 존재를 눈치챈 다른 스코른들은 겁먹고 본능적으로 도망치기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:66
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_8bff3b26:

    # "Soon there was a massive stampede of the beasts fleeing across the desert plains."
    "곧 사막 평원을 가로지르는 거대한 짐승들의 발구름이 이어졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:67
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_cc06e623:

    # "Following behind Ves, I quickly grabbed her once again as the stampede hurried shoulder to shoulder, often smashing and barging violently into each other as they fled."
    "베스의 뒤를 쫓으며 나는 그녀를 다시 한 번 붙잡았다. 발구름 속에서 짐승들은 서로 어깨를 부딪치고, 도망치면서 서로에게 난폭하게 몸을 들이받았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:68
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_a7f5d255:

    # VES "Don't lose him!"
    VES "놓치지 마!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:69
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_b494e7db:

    # "Ves shouted, pointing towards the great Skorn whose trunk smashed into the bulk of a smaller Skorn sending it toppling over onto its side as it fled from us."
    "베스가 외치며 거대한 스코른을 가리켰다. 그 녀석은 긴 코를 작은 스코른의 옆구리에 휘둘러 넘어뜨리며 도망치고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:70
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_c0795b88:

    # VES "Quick! Throw me!"
    VES "빨리! 나를 던져!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:71
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_95e59f81:

    # MC "What?!"
    MC "뭐?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:72
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_8e960187:

    # VES "Just do it!"
    VES "그냥 해!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:73
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_985e4c6e:

    # "Throwing Ves hurtling through the air, she climbed onto the back of one of the Skorn and scaled her way up its hide."
    "베스를 허공으로 힘껏 던지자, 그녀는 스코른 한 마리의 등에 올라타 가죽을 기어올랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:74
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0d1d99ed:

    # "I watched with surprise as she leapt from Skorn to Skorn, gaining on the great beast with greater speed than even I was!"
    "나는 놀라서 지켜봤다. 그녀는 스코른에서 스코른으로 뛰어오르며, 나보다 더 빠르게 거대한 짐승을 따라잡고 있었다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:75
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_526e6bcb:

    # "Narrowly dodging the crazed Skorn, the two of us were finally catching up and close behind the when suddenly..."
    "미친 듯이 달리는 스코른들을 아슬아슬하게 피하며, 우리 둘은 마침내 따라잡기 직전이었다. 그때 갑자기..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:76
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_16c73f3f:

    # "The ground began to vibrate greater than even the herds stamping could cause."
    "땅이 무리의 발굽보다 더 크게 진동하기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:77
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_79d5ca08:

    # "The sand ahead of us began to move as a small whirlpool formed and seemed to sink the ground, dragging nearby Skorn into its pull."
    "우리 앞의 모래가 움직이기 시작하더니, 작은 소용돌이가 생기고 땅이 가라앉았다. 근처의 스코른들을 그 속으로 빨아들이면서."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:82
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_47e05a7e:

    # "Suddenly, a great beast flung itself out of the sands and collided with our Skorn, its huge jaws clasping down onto the beast as it slammed it into the desert sands."
    "갑자기 거대한 짐승이 모래 속에서 튀어나와 우리의 스코른과 충돌했다. 거대한 턱으로 그 짐승을 물고 사막 모래 위로 내리찍었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:83
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_ee1cc2b0:

    # VES "It's a {i}bazark!{/i}"
    VES "{i}바자크{/i}다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:85
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_98cf9cee:

    # "Ves cried out in disbelief, watching as the Skorn screamed out and tried to escape before the bazark slammed its teeth around the throat of the Skorn, violently squeezing and shaking many times till it snapped its neck."
    "베스는 믿을 수 없다는 듯 외쳤다. 스코른이 비명을 지르며 탈출을 시도하는 동안, 바자크는 그 스코른의 목에 이빨을 박아 넣고 목이 부러질 때까지 몇 번이고 세차게 흔들고 조였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:86
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_42cd1029:

    # "Digging its colossal jaws into the soft hide of the Skorn, it gnashed and tore as it swallowed down pieces of its flesh."
    "거대한 턱을 스코른의 부드러운 가죽 속으로 파고들어, 살점을 뜯어 삼켰다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:87
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_1e436363:

    # "Then with a glint in its eye it noticed us still stood there rooted to the ground watching, and turned its attention towards us, snarling malevolently."
    "그러더니 눈에 번뜩이는 빛과 함께, 여전히 바닥에 발이 묶인 채 지켜보고 있는 우리를 알아채고 시선을 돌려 사악하게 으르렁거렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:89
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_345b9452:

    # MC "VES!"
    MC "베스!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:107
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0eaf0c74:

    # "As the bloodied and battered bazark shook its head in a daze, blood dripping down its face onto the hot desert sand, Ves turned to me and shouted breathlessly."
    "피투성이가 되어 만신창이가 된 바자크가 멍한 듯 고개를 흔들며 뜨거운 사막 모래 위로 피를 뚝뚝 흘리는 동안, 베스는 숨을 헐떡이며 나에게 돌아서서 외쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:108
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0733abdf:

    # VES @ talk "{i}*Huff*{/i} It just won't stop coming!"
    VES @ talk "{i}*헉헉*{/i} 계속 달려들어!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:109
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_a09b5db4:

    # "As the bazark continued to shake violently, it pulled up enough of its hide to reveal the soft underbelly of the great beast, revealing some beating organ covered below the thin flesh."
    "바자크가 계속 격렬하게 몸을 흔들면서, 그 거대한 짐승의 부드러운 배 부분이 노출되었다. 얇은 살점 아래에 고동치는 장기 같은 것이 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:110
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_75c5b05a:

    # MC "...Ves I have an idea!"
    MC "...베스, 좋은 생각이 있어!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:111
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_1ca27af3:

    # VES @ talk "What are you—"
    VES @ talk "무슨—"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:112
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_bef099ca:

    # VES @ talk "Whoa!"
    VES @ talk "워악!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:114
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_8643fe33:

    # "Grabbing Ves once again, with frantic motions I began to claw my way up the bazark, my tentacles slamming into the sides of its flesh, tearing out chunks of it as I swung towards the top of the thing."
    "다시 베스를 붙잡고, 나는 정신없는 동작으로 바자크를 기어오르기 시작했다. 내 촉수들이 그 녀석의 살점 옆구리에 박히고, 살덩이를 뜯어내며 꼭대기를 향해 휘둘러 나갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:115
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0daf41b6:

    # "Its claws flailed and slashed around frantically as though we were some itch it needed to scratch, only narrowly missing us as the thing took a swipe at itself, leaving bloody claw marks on its own scaled flesh."
    "그 녀석의 발톱이 미친 듯이 허공을 휘갈기며, 마치 긁어야 할 가려움 같은 우리를 향해 휘둘렀다. 스스로를 할퀴며 비늘 낀 살갗에 피 묻은 발톱 자국을 남겼다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:116
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_6110d4ad:

    # "Finally reaching the top of the bazark, Ves slammed her axes into the flesh to hold herself in place as the thing tried once more to shake us off. Ves looked to me uncertain of what to do next."
    "마침내 바자크의 꼭대기에 도착하자, 베스는 그 녀석이 다시 한 번 우리를 떨쳐내려 할 때 도끼를 살 속에 박아 자세를 잡았다. 베스는 어찌할 바를 몰라 나를 바라봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:117
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_608e1009:

    # VES "Now what?"
    VES "이제 어쩌지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:118
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_aabd5273:

    # MC "I need you to go for its eyes!"
    MC "눈을 노려!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:119
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_abaae829:

    # VES "What!"
    VES "뭐!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:120
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0e70d411:

    # MC "Its eyes! Just go for its eyes!"
    MC "눈! 그냥 눈을 공격해!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:121
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_498ce095:

    # "Quickly, I swung in a circular descent towards the ground once again, feeling the rush of cool air and kicked up desert sand as I felt one of its swinging claws narrowly miss me, forcing me to drop and roll harshly onto the hot desert sand."
    "재빨리 나는 다시 지면을 향해 원을 그리며 하강했다. 시원한 공기의 소용돌이와 일어나는 사막 모래를 느끼며, 휘둘리는 발톱 하나가 아슬아슬하게 나를 빗겨나갔다. 나는 어쩔 수 없이 뜨거운 사막 모래 위로 거칠게 굴러 떨어졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:122
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_b8af20a2:

    # "Under normal circumstances, a few bones would have been broken, but thanks to the parasite's hard exterior I was left a little bruised but mostly unscathed."
    "보통 같으면 뼈 몇 개쯤 부러졌겠지만, 기생체의 단단한 외피 덕분에 멍은 좀 들었어도 거의 상처 하나 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:123
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_b9703b57:

    # "Struggling to stay still on the bazark's back as it tried desperately to rip her from itself, Ves dragged herself forward with swings of her axes."
    "바자크가 필사적으로 그녀를 떼어내려 할 때, 베스는 도끼를 휘둘러 몸을 앞으로 끌어당기며 버텼다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:124
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_c4a82167:

    # "Piercing through the flesh to anchor herself in place till she made it to the front of the beast's reptilian head."
    "살을 찔러 박아 몸을 고정하며, 마침내 짐승의 파충류 같은 머리 앞부분에 도달할 때까지."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:125
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_8516d036:

    # "Its eyes twitched and focused on her when it noticed her lurking there above it, axes raised."
    "눈이 움찔하며, 도끼를 치켜든 그녀가 그 위에 도사리고 있는 것을 알아챘다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:126
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0b90ec4e:

    # "Ves cried out as she slammed her axe into soft eye of the bazark but there was little it could do."
    "베스가 바자크의 부드러운 눈에 도끼를 내리꽂으며 외쳤지만, 그 녀석이 할 수 있는 일은 거의 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:127
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_39aa3e79:

    # "Throwing itself backwards, the great beast flailed helplessly, unsure of what to do with its arms, unable to reach the orc on its head."
    "뒤로 몸을 던지며, 거대한 짐승은 팔을 어찌할 바를 몰라 허우적댔다. 자신의 머리 위에 있는 오크에게 닿을 수 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:128
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_1063faa4:

    # "For a moment, the thing seemed ready to slam itself onto its back and submerge back into the depths of the desert sands, if only to get rid of the orc still hacking away at its eyes."
    "잠시 그 녀석은 등을 땅에 내리찍고 사막 모래 깊은 곳으로 다시 잠수해버릴 태세였다. 계속해서 자신의 눈을 찍어대는 오크를 떨쳐내기 위해서라면."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:129
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_3a444327:

    # "But now, with its underbelly exposed once again I lunged forward, claws ready as I slashed through the flesh and forced myself inside the beast."
    "하지만 이제 다시 배가 드러나자, 나는 발톱을 세우고 앞으로 뛰어들었다. 살점을 가르고 짐승의 몸속으로 파고들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:130
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_8092cf6c:

    # "It now changed course in blind agonising panic and bellowed forward, obviously aware of my presence but it was again too late."
    "그 녀석은 이제 눈먼 고통과 공포에 방향을 바꾸어 앞으로 울부짖었지만, 내 존재를 눈치챈 것은 또다시 너무 늦었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:131
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0ca8dfbe:

    # "Slashing and clawing my way through the bazark's soft flesh with ease, it began desperately to claw at the gaping wound in its soft underbelly to try and pull me out, but it was impossible."
    "바자크의 부드러운 살점을 쉽게 베고 찢으며 나아가자, 그 녀석은 필사적으로 자신의 부드러운 아랫배에 벌어진 상처를 할퀴며 나를 꺼내려 했지만 불가능했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:132
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_f8711ba7:

    # "Forcing my way through the back of the beast I tore my way out in a spray of violence and blood, thick chunks of red meat dropped down onto the coarse sand floor from the gaping hole in which I had emerged from."
    "짐승의 등을 뚫고 나오며, 나는 폭력과 피의 물보라와 함께 몸을 찢어 탈출했다. 내가 빠져나온 거대한 구멍에서 두꺼운 붉은 살덩이들이 거친 모래 바닥 위로 떨어져 내렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:134
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_059bc863:

    # "With one final whimpering howl, the thing slammed dead into the hot sand, its mouth hanging open and quivering for a final few sickening motions in defeat."
    "마지막으로 신음 섞인 울부짖음을 뱉으며, 그 녀석은 뜨거운 모래 위에 숨진 채 쓰러졌다. 입을 벌린 채 패배의 마지막 끔찍한 순간까지 몇 번 경련하며."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:139
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_03637734:

    # MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Ves! Are you okay?"
    MC "{i}*헉헉*{/i} 베스! 괜찮아?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:140
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_8d8378a9:

    # "I looked around frantically for her."
    "나는 정신없이 그녀를 찾았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:141
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_e63f8036:

    # MC "Ves!"
    MC "베스!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:144
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_e746bb12:

    # VES @ talk "I'm alright..."
    VES @ talk "괜찮아..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:145
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_31805282:

    # MC "I can't believe we actually managed to bring that thing down!"
    MC "우리가 정말 저걸 해치웠다니 믿을 수가 없어!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:146
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_216df0f5:

    # "Stepping forward towards the mouth of the dead beast, Ves reached down to carve out and take one of its scales."
    "숨진 짐승의 입가로 다가서서, 베스는 비늘 하나를 도려내 손에 쥐었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:147
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_989a4394:

    # VES @ talk "For such a prized kill as this, we'd normally take the skull to honour a War Hall."
    VES @ talk "이런 귀한 사냥감은, 보통 전쟁의 전당을 기리기 위해 두개골을 가져가지."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:148
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_0d3e54d4:

    # VES @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i} But I suppose this will have to do..."
    VES @ talk "{i}*휴우*{/i} 하지만 이걸로 만족해야겠지..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:149
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_42d4318b:

    # "Looking over at the dead Skorn we were hunting earlier, I glanced at Ves uncertainly."
    "아까 우리가 사냥하던 죽은 스코른을 바라보며, 나는 망설이며 베스를 쳐다봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:150
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_7c7f45a7:

    # MC "Hey, how are we going to carry this damn thing back now?"
    MC "야, 이 망할 걸 어떻게 다시 가지고 가지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:151
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_91a4bf23:

    # "Ves looked at me and smiled."
    "베스가 나를 바라보며 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:152
translate kr qst_ValleyOfPrey_5a09e725:

    # MC "... Oh no."
    MC "... 아, 안 돼."

translate kr strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/side/valleyOfDeath/ValleyOfPrey/scr.rpy:45
    old "Valley of Death"
    new "죽음의 계곡"
